    "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<div><b>Acceptance Criteria</b> </div><ul><li><b>Permissions</b><ul><li>Permissions (Read, Update, Delete, Assign) must be assignable per template and per folder, to individual users or to workgroups. </li><li>Read grants viewing the template (and using it in reporting); Update grants modifying a template or folder; Delete grants deleting a template or folder; Assign grants changing permissions on it. </li><li>A new template or folder must inherit its parent folder's permissions by default. </li><li>Changing a folder's permissions must support applying the change to: this node only (default), this node and all child nodes, all child nodes only, this node and all parent nodes, or this node and all child and parent nodes. </li> </ul> </li> </ul>",
